client: skip the engine version check on the web, as yohimik's "fix: version check" (ad5629e) did

HUD_GetRenderInterface compares the engine's reported version with MIN_XASH_VERSION and
raises Host_Error when it is lower; the web engine reports a version this check refuses,
so the check is skipped there. Marked "fix?" in the original; kept as it was.

--- a/cl_dll/cdll_int.cpp
+++ b/cl_dll/cdll_int.cpp
@@ -339,6 +339,10 @@
 	// we didn't send callbacks to engine, because we don't use it
 	// *callback = renderInterface;
 
+// fix?
+#ifdef XASH_EMSCRIPTEN
+    return true;
+#endif
 	// we have here a Host_Error, so check Xash for version
 	if( g_iXash < MIN_XASH_VERSION )
 	{
